[{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":5},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":3},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":6},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":1},{"op":"background","image":"bg009"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",316],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我醒来时已过了中午。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看看钟，伸了个懒腰。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"手肘关节发出嘎吱一声，感觉有点爽。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg035"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"由于是休息天，路上熙熙攘攘的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在家也没什么事做，本可以出去的…，然而出去了同样没事可做。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我本想随便找个书店逛一逛，结果也没找到什么想买的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"话虽如此，我可不想就这样回去跟老爹打照面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…还是去春原那吧…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我叹着气停下脚步，转变身体朝向。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":7},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哒哒哒哒哒～…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚才还想有什么东西从我脚边跑过去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可要说是猫猫狗狗，似乎又太圆了…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗噗～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「牡丹…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有个小野猪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是那个背上条纹特别明显的野猪幼崽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也就是说…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",306],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊，朋也。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「果然你也在啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我耷拉着肩膀叹气。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你这什么表情啊，因为来的不是椋，感觉很失望吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我可没打算说这个啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「只不过不想在大街上被人大声喊名字罢了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊哈哈哈，别在意别在意。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「话说，你们在这里干什么呢？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯？你不也看见了嘛，散步啊，散步。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「牡丹待了那么久终于也恢复精神了，就放他出来看看。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～噗～♪」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这样啊…是藤林的便当…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊哈哈…是啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏尴尬地笑着看向牡丹。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过幸好它能恢复健康。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「就是说。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你别太勉强它，散步也要适度哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，我抬起一只手打了个招呼，便转身背对杏准备走。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你今天很闲是吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「？算是吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那正好，你陪我吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我正想问要陪她干啥，小腿附近就有东西靠上来了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～噗～♪」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「牡丹它想跟你一起玩嘛。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…也就是说…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我眯起眼睛看着杏。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「散步♪我们一起走～♪」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的眼睛眯得更细了，正准备就此离去，在我的脚尖前面──…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘎吱…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个热乎乎的东西抱住了我的脚踝。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我低头一看，只见牡丹正用前腿抱着我的脚。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那小短腿拼命努力着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽说要甩开它并不难──…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"圆滚滚的眼眸勾起了我的罪恶感…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「就这么定啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到我这副模样，杏满意地笑道。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",317],"value":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":2},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～♪噗～♪」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"牡丹看起来非常兴奋地向前跑去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"短尾巴一翘一翘地摇摆着，时不时停下打转，还噗噗地叫唤。"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":9},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「牡丹心情很好嘛～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「看就知道了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「看到它这个样子，不由得就会感觉很平静对吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊，看起来就没什么心机…呆头呆脑的…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「可你也不想看到一只忧郁的牡丹垂头丧气地走路对吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那倒的确是的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗噗～♪」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…说起来，牡丹很嫌弃藤林对吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊？哦，嗯，算是吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「她干什么了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky18e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊～…这个嘛…原因也不是没有啦…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…究竟怎么了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那是之前她帮牡丹泡澡时候的事。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，泡澡啊…挺不错的嘛。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不是～然后呢～，洗澡水啊，稍微有点烫了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…它以为自己要被煮成火锅了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊哈哈…大概就是这么回事吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏尴尬地笑着说到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「说起来，你有约椋出来玩吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？是啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「她看起来超开心的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「在家里抱着枕头蹦蹦跳跳的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…藤林的这个模样有点难以想象啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「她还有许多方面是你不知道的呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊。毕竟开始交往…甚至可以说，开始能正常对话也只是一周前的事啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，和那家伙在一起，每一天都会很新奇。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「昨天我也跟她说了，这很有意义。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏默默地听我说着，闭上眼微微笑了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯～我又被秀了一脸恩爱啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我可没这个意思啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「行啦行啦，我就当是这样吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏耸耸肩，摇了摇头说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「说起来，她将来的目标是成为护士啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯，所以她今天才会去听学校的宣讲会啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你也要好好决定未来的方向哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「未来的方向啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「顺带一提，我将来的方向啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你要是说想变成美丽的新娘，当心我笑喷出来哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky20c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「傻瓜。我想做幼儿园老师啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「唔哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊哈哈哈哈哈！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「朋也～你的道歉在哪呢？嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊…不好意思…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky31c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不行，我不原谅你…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「牡丹。七绝技之一，橄榄球形态。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她打了一个响指，牡丹的小短腿就收了起来。"},{"op":"background","image":"siro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着…她把它冲着我的脸扔了过来…。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg035"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「总觉得…这个畜生的七绝技全都透着虐待动物的感觉啊…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你说什么呢，牡丹玩的开心就不算虐待啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，这样啊…。我顺便问问，还有些啥？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「其他的？按摩功能，还能当枕头之类的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…按摩？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「牡丹？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「牡丹，来个按摩吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗！」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt10"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":5},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哇！震成这样不会出事吗？！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「当然没问题啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要不是事先听你说了招式名，这样子还真挺惊悚的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「把它放在肩膀上可舒服了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「行啦，牡丹停。」"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":9},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那接下来是枕头。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～♪」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「来。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt17"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":3},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…这跟之前的布偶没区别啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「完全不一样好吗。你摸摸它肚皮。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…肚皮…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听她这么说，我伸出手去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咕…唧…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…这手感是怎么回事…慢弹回材料…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「就像太空棉一样对吧～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…莫非你，枕着它睡觉？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「偶尔会啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"果然还是虐待动物啊…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哦，对了对了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？怎么了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你看。就是那边，那家店。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「服装店怎么了…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你看那模特，很可爱对吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏手指指向一个女性假人模特。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"它穿着的，是两边各有两条肩带的，短小的白色吊带衫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可以一直看到模特的肚脐。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…露的是不是有点太多了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不懂了吧～露一点才可爱嘛。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「男人看了都会因为可爱和妖媚而神魂颠倒的呀。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「呵…神魂颠倒…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你想象一下啊，要是椋穿着这个，会是什么样？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「藤林穿那个…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky24c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你别看她那样，其实胸…还挺有料的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「真，真的？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「随便一挤就有沟了呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「沟…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那…那家伙明明长着一张那么纯情的脸，居然…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唧～！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哎哟疼疼疼！你别扯我耳朵啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我说～你刚才可是色眯眯的一脸下流样哦！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊？哪有什么下流…疼疼疼。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「就是有啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「要是这次约会你敢乱来，当心我往你眼睛里浇肉酱！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「而且还不是水性的，是黏糊糊的那种！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「顺便再免费送你蛋黄酱鲣鱼片和海苔！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"等我回过神来，发现牡丹也在瞪着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知是不是错觉，它似乎在淌着口水…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「杏，我就问下，牡丹喜欢吃什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky10c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「什锦烧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"区区一只畜生…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"随后我和杏还有牡丹一边散步，一边浏览着临街橱窗的商品，就这么走了一段。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"橱窗里展示的商品和上个周日相比并没什么变化，然而杏的兴致却丝毫不减。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看起来反而比上次更加欢快。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"此时她正摆弄着杂货铺柜台里陈列的储蓄罐，心情十分不错。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"牡丹在一边学着它主人的样子，摇着尾巴颇为兴奋。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…看来女人都爱光看不买的购物体验啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯？那是啊。能有各种想象，不也挺开心的嘛。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「看商店橱窗的时候，九成以上都是这种啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「看着自己绝对不会去买的东西，就不觉得空虚吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哎～真受不了你，所以说男人无趣嘛～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你怎么就这么实际呢？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这叫现实主义好吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我看只是你头脑简单吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky10c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「比起拥有，光是看着也有其独特的乐趣呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「把所有的东西全都变成自己的东西，很无趣不是吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不…我总觉得有哪里不一样…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「先不说这些了，你看这个储蓄罐是不是很可爱？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，她举起手里那个狸猫形象的储蓄罐给我看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"瞪得大大的眼珠里映照出我的脸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…可爱吗…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你看它的眼珠圆滚滚的，不是吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这个不叫圆滚滚吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"都快瞪出血来了…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky18c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「是吗？我觉得还挺可爱的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏略显失望地说着，把储蓄罐放回原来的位置。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那这个呢？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她抓着边上那个储蓄罐给我看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…提灯鮟鱇鱼…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「超帅气的，对吧？我都快迷上它了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「听说放钱进去的时候这根触须会发光的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…太真实了反而有点恶心…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你眼睛是不是有病啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我想应该比你要正常一点…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你什么意思，是不是在说我审美差啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我想至少说不上好吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「杏，你觉得这家伙怎么样？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我指着脚边转来转去的牡丹问她。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯！超可爱的！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"先不说表现力的问题，这么看来她的感性至少还算正常。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你觉得呢？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这回轮到杏问我了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我盯着脚边的牡丹看了看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"牡丹也看着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「看着挺好吃。」"},{"op":"background","image":"siro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我诚实地答道，然后被揍了。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg035"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",314],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们在杂货铺前待了一会儿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟这里卖的东西多种多样，看着也不会觉得无聊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而…等我回过神来，杏已经不见了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…？喂，牡丹，你的主人去哪儿了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"牡丹歪着脑袋。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「她也不可能放着牡丹不管自己回去…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可是我环顾一圈，没见她人影。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗…噗～噗～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"牡丹可怜巴巴地叫唤着。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯？怎么了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，找到了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～♪」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":7},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一看到杏的身影，牡丹便跑向她脚边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～噗～」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哇，这是怎么了？牡丹你蹭得我好痒哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你刚才去哪儿啦？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哦，我去买了点东西。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，她拿起个纸袋给我看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是这家店的。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哎呀，没想到杂货铺真是什么都有卖呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你买了什么啊？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky10c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯？你看呀。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她不直接作答，而是把纸袋递给我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"摸起来，好像是个小小的方形物体。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「礼物。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…给我的？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「让你带给椋的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她若无其事地说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…你们回家不就能碰上面吗？自己去给嘛。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你是真傻啊。我是让你把这个当成你给她的礼物送出去啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那你先跟我说一声啊，我自己会买。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我都说了是我的礼物啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是给藤林的？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「同时，也是给你的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你就大胆送出去吧，好感度一定蹭蹭往上涨。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏爽朗地笑着说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这家伙可真是…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也不知该说她爱管闲事，还是会照顾人…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我想这就是她的性格，也是她的优点。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哦，作为给我的回报，你要再陪我多散一会儿步哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我还有最后一个地方要去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，我没问题。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那就说好咯。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏满足地笑着，打了一个响指。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我再问一句，里面装的是什么啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「塔罗牌。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是这样啊…」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg080"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",316],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～♪噗～♪」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在蓝蓝的天，白白的云下，牡丹超级兴奋的。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg039"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":2},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗，噗～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「它也真够欢乐的。」"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":9},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「这里是牡丹最喜欢的地方了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是不是因为绿色多，把它野性的基因都唤醒了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不晓得。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不过…这里对它来说也是充满了回忆的地方啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「回忆…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯。牡丹，就是在这里被捡到的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…捡到…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你该不会以为，牡丹是我从店里买下来的吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦…倒不是…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也是啊…一般来说宠物店怎么可能卖野猪幼崽呢…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky22d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「这孩子是在一个雨天，在这里独自发着抖。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",326],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「周围也没有父母兄弟…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「野猪呢，是只会照顾跟在自己背后那些幼崽的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky23d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「也不知它是跟丢了，还是自己走丢了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「总之这孩子是变成孤身一人了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「就因为这个，我才把它带回家了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这父母当得也够狠的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky22d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「可是，这样才像是动物嘛。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我听说野猪自幼就是自己觅食的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「猪妈妈除了奶什么也不喂。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「或许就是想通过这么做，教会小猪生存的严酷吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「丛林法则…是吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「大概是吧。其实也没错，毕竟不可能永远和父母兄弟在一起嘛。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏苦笑了笑。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后她用柔和的目光看着草地上来回奔驰着的牡丹。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「虽然是这样，可我还是觉得这里对它来说很重要。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「就算它是被父母抛弃的，这里也留着它的回忆。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「也留着亲情和温暖啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她说着，目光很温柔…却又透着一丝悲伤。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky17d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「可是，这也不可能一直保留下去，对吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky23d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「说不定哪天这里就会被建成车库，建成公寓楼…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那么…这个对牡丹来说很重要的地方也就消失了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这也没办法啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这么大一片空地，一直放着不管也挺浪费的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky22d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯…你说的可能没错…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「可这只是人类自说自话不是吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…可以，这么说吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过…就算没有了这里，我看牡丹也不会有事的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky10d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「为什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「因为它有了比这里更加重要的地方啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「更加…重要的地方？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「在那个雨天抱住它那冰凉的身体的，是你对吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「而且你又为它重新建起了本应已经失去的归宿，对吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我想，那一定是个温馨又宁静的地方。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我想对牡丹来说，现在最重要的地方，就是你的身边啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听了我的话，杏瞪大了双眼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？我说了什么不该说的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊…不是，嗯，我只是有点佩服你了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「佩服？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你这个人啊，有时候会很一本正经地说出超羞耻的话。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…我怎么觉得你不是在夸我呢…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我是拐着弯儿夸你呢。拐着弯哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，她调皮地一笑，目光转向牡丹。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也叹了口气，一样看着牡丹。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":8},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小野猪也没注意到我们的目光，自顾自地在草地上跑来跑去。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky19c"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",320],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「朋也。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「谢谢啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…？谢什么？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「谢谢你对我说，我身边是它很重要的地方。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「谢谢你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「笨蛋。这点事就不用道谢啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不像我的风格？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，完全不像。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那你就感到荣幸吧，本小姐说了这么珍稀的话。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏笑着说到。我则报以苦笑。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky18c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「说起来…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？这次又是啥？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我要一下子转移话题…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「是关于椋的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯嗯。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky19d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你…和她…那个…亲过了吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我嗡地一声转过头来看着杏。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊…看你这样子似乎还没有啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么叫还没有…我和她交往到现在才只有一周时间好吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「这种事和时间没关系。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「关键是看场景和时机。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要是我对藤林乱来就杀了我，这是你自己说的没错吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky18d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「只是亲一下的话──…我还能接受的啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦…这样…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是亲一下…是吧。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「难不成…你还没跟别人亲过？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不行吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯，也没什么不行…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不就是嘴对嘴嘛，根本就不是什么难事。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「什么叫嘴对嘴，别说的那么轻巧好吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"『对女孩子来说初吻可是很重要的。』"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「毕竟第一次可是要记上一辈子的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「对男生也一样的好吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky14c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「可女孩子要细腻得多啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏一本正经地用手指指着我的脸说到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「椋那么内向，你一定要主动一点才行啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「要是没头没脑错过机会，反而会更加难相处哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你的意思…是要我赶紧去吻她？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky16d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哎…？啊…啊啊…这个…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…我，我也…不是那个意思…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…唔唔～…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky18e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她支支吾吾地说不出话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着，她抵着嘴角沉吟着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看着杏，叹了口气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们一时之间都没有说话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我望着跑来跑去的牡丹，杏则低着头看着地面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她抵着嘴角的姿势倒没有变化。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"之前已经看到好多次了，估计这是她想事情时候的习惯。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…如果真是这样，她在想什么呢…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…要…试试看吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我没理解她说了什么，反应慢了一拍。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「要接个吻…试试看吗…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是她又说了一遍。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这次我听懂了…可──。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啥？！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我忍不住大声喊了回去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏正直勾勾地盯着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…你…知道自己在说什么吗…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky16e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊…这个…怎么说呢，练习？对就是练习。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「要是正式上场的时候搞砸了会很丢脸不是吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「直白点说一定会变成心理阴影。今后一辈子都不想再接吻了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要有多失败才会成这样啊…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky19d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「所，所以…这个，…来…练练吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「这样…很荒唐吗…？哈哈，应该很荒唐吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我在瞎说些什么呢…这种事显然很荒唐啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏看起来非常尴尬，目光不断游移着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一言不发地看着杏。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky16d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊…唔～…」"},{"op":"choice","id":"3503:2066550","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"练习试试","value":0,"serial":2066550},{"text":"默默地看着杏","value":1,"serial":2066560}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":743,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我上前一步，把手搭在杏的肩上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「杏。」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgky05c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",315],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她纤细的肩膀微微一抖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着她似乎吓了一跳，看着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「朋也…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是…练习对吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「嗯…就是练习…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完，我们两人四目紧紧相对。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我感到嘴唇在迅速变干燥。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你…你就把我…当成是椋…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「脸…再靠近一点…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「近到你看不出我们两个头发长度的区别…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我按照她说的，把脸凑了过去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"洗发水朦胧的香味刺激着我的鼻子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏的脸占据了我的视野，再也看不出头发的长短。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我和椋，很像吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真的好像…除了眼睛略有不同，其余几乎一模一样…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也是啊…她们──…是双胞胎嘛…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「所以你就把我当成她，来练习。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…杏…」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgky05a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「不对…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她说着，眼睛微微眯起…眼眸中多了些之前没有见过的色彩…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…你要是不叫我椋…怎么能算是练习呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「这可是…练习啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我搭在杏肩头的手微微用上了力。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"能感觉出杏的全身都僵硬了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在干什么呢…？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接吻…？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"练习接吻…？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和谁…？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"藤林的双胞胎姐姐…？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样可以吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为长得像就拿来练习…可以吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这怎么──…。"},{"op":"background","image":"fgky05b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就在我理性开始复苏的瞬间，眼前杏的表情发生了变化。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她闭上眼，静静的，像是在等待着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然身体的僵硬没有改变，但表情已经变得柔和了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"闭上眼睛，使得她跟藤林更像了…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"涌上心头的理性和疑问瞬间消散。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的目光只集中在眼前那小小的嘴唇上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"心脏跳的又快又猛，我都怀疑是不是会被杏听到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"身体不顾意识的控制，自己动了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就像被杏吸引过去一般。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就像被眼前那小小嘴唇吸引过去一般…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我闭上眼，脸慢慢凑近那个位置。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"干燥的嘴唇微微感到一丝温热传来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再一点就碰上了…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…再有一点点──…。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":651,"condition":["&&",["&&",["==",255,255],["==",255,255]],["==",255,255]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪★"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「？！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然我的双颊感受到轻轻的冲击，让我睁开双眼。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg039"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",322],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看见了同样睁开双眼的杏。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的双手正贴在我了两边脸上。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「好啦，练习结束。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…哎…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「这是练习啊，总不能真亲上去吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，杏向后退开一步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我搭在她肩头的手无力地垂了下来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「感觉还不错，时间的把控之类的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「被你盯着看的时候，我都心跳加速了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「呃…啊，嗯…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「总之，作为第一次来说很不错嘛。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「依这个状态来，一定不会搞砸的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏以她那一贯的神色，满意地笑着说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而对我来说…却有一种被打懵的感觉。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「也差不多了，我要回去啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「谢谢你陪我跟牡丹散步啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，杏呼唤了牡丹。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听到主人的声音，牡丹欢快地跑了过来。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗ー噗ー♪」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着它在我脚边蹦来蹦去。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「喂，好啦牡丹，我们要回去了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt11"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～噗～♪」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…它哼叫着抓住我的脚。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「看起来，它很喜欢我嘛。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky25c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「的确哦。看起来你们很般配哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「好啦，牡丹，我们该回去了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～噗～♪」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky13c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「真受不了你，快过来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…我陪你回去吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky15c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哎？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「反正我也闲着，就送你回家吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「还挺远的哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「可要是我不动，牡丹也不会动啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～♪」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky26c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「哎…嗯…好像是哦…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏挠着脸颊，以明显无可奈何的语气说着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，牡丹啊，你先放开我的脚啊，不然我要踩到你了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听到我这么说，牡丹听话地退开两三步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别看它长成这样，还挺聪明啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky12c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「毕竟是我的宠物呀。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「考虑到这点就更意外啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky24c"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「你什么意思？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你别深究了，走吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1001],"value":"cgbt11"},{"op":"callScene","scene":9078,"entry":7},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"见我走了起来，牡丹也就跟在后面。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「……朋也。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…谢谢你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我就是闲着所以送送你，没什么可谢我的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「…我说的不是这个…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…？…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「总而言之，各种事情啦，谢谢你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「虽说不是很明白，不过你客气啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗～？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看着我和杏，牡丹歪了歪脑袋。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",309],"value":1},{"op":"ifFalse","to":768,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky21d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊…啊～…那个，刚才的忘掉吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「是我自己头脑发热，闲事管过头了啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「再说练习接吻什么的根本不可能嘛，嗯，不可能的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊哈哈哈，她自顾自笑着打算蒙混过关。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而我这边，实话说，根本说不出什么来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"似乎是受不了这气氛了，杏不知所措地低下头。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky16d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「啊…这个…对不起…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不…你也没做什么需要道歉的事啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「可是…不知怎么的就…抱歉…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…嗯…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"见她这么说，我也只能微微地点一下头。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky22d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「我…差不多该回去了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？哦哦，这样啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「牡丹。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"远处的牡丹听到杏的声音顿时就有了反应，向这边跑来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgky11d"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「谢谢你陪牡丹散步啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"杏","text":"「那么，明天见啦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"牡丹跑到杏的脚边，依然喘着粗气，以好奇的眼神看着主人。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"jumpScene","scene":3504,"entry":0},{"op":"return"}]